    "description": "<p><strong>Psionic</strong></p><p>Make a <strong>Power Roll</strong> against a target within Very Close range. Once per rest on a success, you overwhelm the target's neural focus through voice and presence, briefly short-circuiting their ability to react. The target becomes temporarily <em>Stunned</em> and must <strong>mark a Stress</strong>. Until the end of the scene, you can make additional Power Rolls against the same target; on a success, their mind falters again and they are temporarily <em>Stunned</em>.</p>",
